{"articleNo":"76906","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=76906&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"졸업가능여부 확인시스템 제공 알림(대상자 수정)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.02.20","hit":"7854","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">졸업가능여부 확인시스템을 아래와 같이 제공함을 알려드립니다.</span></span><br></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #7c43b1\" color=\"#ffffff\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">『졸업가능여부 확인시스템』</span></strong></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong><font color=\"#660033\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">▷ 졸업가능 여부를 실시간으로 확인/점검/예측할 수 있도록 구축된 시스템 </span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong><font color=\"#660033\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong><font color=\"#660033\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">▷&nbsp;</span></font></strong></span>수강신청 참고자료로 활용 가능합니다.</span><br></font></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">1. 메뉴 구성 : 각 이수구분별로 졸업 관련 내역 조회 가능</span><br></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.&nbsp;기본자료 : 주전공</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나.&nbsp;추가이수자료 : 공학인증, 부전공, 복수전공, 연계전공, 교직과정</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><br><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">2. 확인 경로</span><br></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">[원스톱서비스≫학사관리≫졸업≫졸업가능여부 확인자료 조회/출력]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><br><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">3.&nbsp;제공&nbsp;기간(변경될 수 있습니다.)</span><br></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#660033\">4학년 이상(건축학전공은 5학년 이상)</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 2013.02.25.(월)~02.28.(목) [전체학년 수강신청기간~]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 2013.03.06.(수)~03.08.(금) [수강신청 확인 및 변경기간]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 2013.03.13.(수)~03.15.(금) [수강신청 정정기간(폐강,분반과목)]</span></p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#660033\">3학년 이상(건축학전공은 4학년 이상)</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp;자료 확인 지연으로 인해 제공 기간이 연기되었습니다.</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 제공 시 수정 공지하겠습니다.</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 2013.03.06.(수)~03.08.(금) [수강신청 확인 및 변경기간]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 2013.03.13.(수)~03.15.(금) [수강신청 정정기간(폐강,분반과목)]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다.&nbsp;<font color=\"#660033\">2013년 8월 졸업예정자의 졸업예비사정내역&nbsp;</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">2013.03.04.(월)[10시 개시]~03.29.(금)[18시 마감]</span><br></span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">추가일정 및 변경사항 발생 시 공문 및 홈페이지 공지사항을 통하여 알려드립니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp; </p><hr style=\"BORDER-TOP: black 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: black; BORDER-BOTTOM-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: black; HEIGHT: 1px; BORDER-RIGHT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: black\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2013. 02. 20.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">교 무 처 장</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
